  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 33 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the usual clear order, the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Needs: courtyard door, Sorcerer's door and Arugal's door (GO_COURTYARD_DOOR, GO_SORCERER_DOOR, GO_ARUGAL_DOOR) opened by the keep script as bosses die",
    "Needs: Arugal's summoning focus (GO_ARUGAL_FOCUS)",
    "Turtle adds Sever (14682), Prelate Ironmane (61969) and a second Arugal row (10000) that are not legs.",
    "Fix round 2026-10-22 (PREP-SFK census): cc_priority = the Shadowfang Darksouls (3855, they shield themselves in shadow on aggro), the Spectral Clerics (61970, the court's casters) and the intro Arugal (10000, a 26 elite with 6510 hp that stands in the pull beside Odo's yard); all three have mechanic_immune_mask 0. No fleers in the legs of this file (only Ashcrombe 3850, a friendly, and Wolfguard Worg 5058, leg 6) and no cc_always/kill_first: no trash stuns the party and Springvale heals his own guards, but he is the pull target himself."
